#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064049 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f07c0f22-39fe-5576-8aab-e2dfdb3227b8" :knowledge-point/title "Integrating the Hyperbolic Sine and the Hyperbolic Cosine"}] :question/id #uuid "82a52178-7e95-554c-aedb-34e2f0336fa5" :question/math-academy-id "e-8341" :question/problem "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nCalculate $\\displaystyle \\int 8\\cosh t \\,\\textrm{d}t$." :question/worked-solution "Recall that\n\n$$\n\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits} \\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d t}(\\sinh t) = \\cosh{t} \\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad \\int \\cosh{t} \\, \\textrm dt = \\sinh{t} + C\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n∫8\\cosh tdt = 8∫\\cosh tdt = 8\\sinh t + C\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064050 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4daf1299-2291-5bf0-8267-68efcfe4e27d" :knowledge-point/title "Integrating Hyperbolic Secant-Tangent and Cosecant-Cotangent"}] :question/id #uuid "94c41155-d10a-55e6-8483-34750849a283" :question/math-academy-id "e-8342" :question/problem "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\n$\\displaystyle \\int \\left(-3\\sech x \\tanh x\\right) \\,\\textrm{d}x =$" :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}\n$$\n\nRecall that\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d x}(\\sech x) = -\\sech{x}\\tanh x \\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad \\int \\sech{x}\\tanh{x} \\, \\textrm dx = -\\sech{x} + C\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n∫(-3sech x\\tanh x)dx &= -3∫sech x\\tanh xdx \\\\\n&=-3(-sech x) + C \\\\\n&= 3sech x + C\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064051 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e1992086-0858-551d-a6dc-042276c5d7f9" :knowledge-point/title "Integrating the Square of the Hyperbolic Secant"}] :question/id #uuid "ed338404-097d-55ca-8d99-18e421934afd" :question/math-academy-id "e-8343" :question/problem "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\n$\\displaystyle \\int 6\\sech^2 x \\,\\textrm{d}x =$" :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}\n$$\n\nRecall that\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d x}(\\tanh x) = \\sech^2{x} \\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad \\int \\sech^2{x} \\, \\textrm dx = \\tanh{x} + C\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n∫6sech^{2} xdx = 6∫sech^{2} xdx = 6\\tanh x + C\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064052 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "273bab01-0930-5580-b073-8bafe7505887" :knowledge-point/title "Integrating the Square of the Hyperbolic Cosecant"}] :question/id #uuid "cdb3db67-7734-5828-8b55-2faa5aee8541" :question/math-academy-id "e-8344" :question/problem "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\n$\\displaystyle \\int (-8\\csch^2 x)\\,\\textrm{d}x =$" :question/worked-solution "$$\n\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}\n$$\n\nRecall that\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d x}(\\coth x) = -\\csch^2{x} \\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad \\int \\csch^2{x} \\, \\textrm dx = -\\coth{x} + C\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n∫(-8csch^{2} x)dx &= -8∫csch^{2} xdx \\\\\n&= - (-8\\coth x) + C \\\\\n&= 8\\coth x + C\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064877 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f07c0f22-39fe-5576-8aab-e2dfdb3227b8" :knowledge-point/title "Integrating the Hyperbolic Sine and the Hyperbolic Cosine"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "84c5bfe8-7647-5ebe-8e34-68c72b149298" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{π}\\sinh x + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186063772} {:answer/id #uuid "90dfdda3-2167-5a1e-af6d-05328624c819" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "π\\sinh x + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186063773} {:answer/id #uuid "cffd2366-142a-5f42-b391-b5154735889c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- π\\cosh x + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186063774} {:answer/id #uuid "ffaa2867-df78-51cc-8e29-88d5f15299cc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "π\\cosh x + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186063775} {:answer/id #uuid "5d78b98e-635d-5f1d-9cae-770989d2adfa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{π}\\cosh x + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186063776}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ffaa2867-df78-51cc-8e29-88d5f15299cc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math